### infra/flatten-openapi.ts
**Timestamp:** Earlier today
**Change:** Created new OpenAPI schema flattening utility
**Details:** 
- Created comprehensive schema flattening tool to resolve allOf, oneOf, and anyOf constructs
- Implements recursive schema traversal with circular reference protection using visited Set
- Handles allOf by merging all sub-schemas, combining properties and required arrays
- Handles oneOf and anyOf by taking first option (simplified approach)
- Recursively processes nested schemas in properties, items, and additionalProperties
- Flattens all schemas in components.schemas section
- Flattens all parameters in components.parameters section
- Outputs to '../src/openapi/nationalweatherservice-flattened.json'
- Includes console logging for completion confirmation
- This provides an alternative to dereference.ts for handling complex OpenAPI schema constructs
- Total: 108 lines of TypeScript code

