### src/openapi/weather-agent.json
**Timestamp:** 2025-10-27 (Monday) - Latest
**Change:** Created new weather agent OpenAPI specification
**Details:** 
- Created complete OpenAPI 3.0.0 specification for a weather agent API
- Defined server URL pointing to Bedrock Agent Core runtime endpoint
- Added POST /invocations endpoint:
  - Accepts weather queries via "prompt" field in request body
